{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What's available in this Demo:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo includes the first three regions of <i>Hopward</i> \u2014 the Pond and Wizard Tower and Sky temple</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > letting you experience the core jump and glide mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your progress will not carry over to the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109000/extras/bbbf5ff0d1bcc485da92872b21640702.avif?t=1761252067\" width=432 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hopward is a vertical precision platformer set in a whimsical yet punishing world of pure vertical challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a determined little frog with one goal: <strong>reach the top</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with only a <strong>chargeable jump</strong> and a <strong>mid-air dive</strong>, you'll conquer a towering world of tricky platforms and mystical zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No shortcuts. No checkpoints. <strong>No Autosaves\u2014unless you earn them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fall, learn, and hop again.</strong><br><strong>Each fall hurts. Each jump counts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109000/extras/fcf8d0888abf401a21808ef452d9a832.poster.avif?t=1761252067\" width=620 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109000/extras/fcf8d0888abf401a21808ef452d9a832.webm?t=1761252067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109000/extras/f5625863249a5d2e209b401d8fc03484.avif?t=1761252067\" width=432 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold to charge, release to Hop. Your only tool is your jump and your own skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109000/extras/b9865e18604f9596dbe74c4753a7e34b.poster.avif?t=1761252067\" width=620 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109000/extras/b9865e18604f9596dbe74c4753a7e34b.webm?t=1761252067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109000/extras/b8bd0c7dadb70b8711a1371787397e37.avif?t=1761252067\" width=432 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start in a rainy pond, scale massive trees, brave arcane towers, bounce through beanstalks, and float among dreamy islands in the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109000/extras/6c525374e0c49bb483b30c913d271a3d.poster.avif?t=1761252067\" width=620 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109000/extras/6c525374e0c49bb483b30c913d271a3d.webm?t=1761252067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109000/extras/91c2ed5758182710a7da2b89b1566135.avif?t=1761252067\" width=432 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every slip can send you tumbling down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But falling isn\u2019t failure\u2014it\u2019s part of the journey. Learn, adjust, and climb again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109000/extras/6c6d10333af9e76d87ed6b9d8997f07e.poster.avif?t=1761252067\" width=620 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109000/extras/6c6d10333af9e76d87ed6b9d8997f07e.webm?t=1761252067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4109000?t=1761252067","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4109000?t=1761252067","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109000/06f665d4c4d19eda7c6b80f7fd596d64d2eee035/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761252067","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109000/06f665d4c4d19eda7c6b80f7fd596d64d2eee035/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761252067","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"deta